  unitName: Demon Champion Raaga
  unitId: 50696
  unitNumber: 922
  description: A demon obsessed with battle referred to as the "god of martial arts."
    Wandering around Ishgria seeking a strong opponent to fight, Raaga ran into a
    black demon who sought to destroy a younger demon standing not too far away.
    Seeing Raaga, the black demon fled instantly, while the half-dead youngster continued
    to stare into Raaga's eyes. Raaga then took the youngster in and raised him in
    order to turn him into a worthy rival. However, he was ultimately defeated by
    his own pupil, and his feelings on the matter remain unknown to this day.
  summonDesc: I don't seek victory, but the revelation of power through training.
    Nothing more, nothing less.
  fusionDesc: The strong recognize their own power. The power they lack, they borrow.
    In short, you are strong.
  evoDesc: Are those who protect others weak or strong? Seek the answer to that for
    yourself.
  element: 5
  rarity: 6
